  <recipient-country code="GB" percentage="100">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scope of the Contract is wide ranging given the responsive nature of the programme. The Supplier will manage the delivery arm of the Resource Centre &#x2013; identifying and mobilising flexible, demand-led technical assistance to ODA-eligible countries, in the form of short-term (up to 6 months), medium (6 to 12 months) and longer-term (including multiyear interventions) advisory support in the fields of tax, public financial management and broader macro-fiscal work, including debt management.</narrative>
  </recipient-country>
